OL,3,GNEWSABBC drama Shetland to return for
OL,4,A12th series
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC detective drama Shetland is to
OL,7,Freturn for a 12th series, with filming
OL,8,Fstarting next year.
OL,10,FThe new six-part series will see the
OL,11,Freturn of Ashley Jensen, playing DI
OL,12,FRuth Calder, and longstanding cast
OL,13,Fmembers Steven Robertson as DS Sandy
OL,14,FWilson and Lewis Howden as PC Billy
OL,15,FMcCabe.
OL,17,FBut DI Tosh McIntosh will be a notable
OL,18,Fabsence because one of the original
OL,19,Fstars, Alison O'Donnell, leaves the
OL,20,Fdrama at the end of the current series
OL,21,Ffollowing a 13-year stint.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
