OL,3,GNEWSABBC drama Shetland to return for
OL,4,A12th series
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has promised a "memorable"
OL,7,Fdeparture from the show, with the first
OL,8,Fepisode leaving fans in suspense as she
OL,9,Fwas left trapped in a locked water
OL,10,Ftank.
